{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19105210","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19105210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910521001:1":{"text":"이게 대체...","source_cn":"我……不明白……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEF9E5FBFDE795ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910521002:1":{"text":"那片潮光……是什么？为什么深海裔走进去光芒中，就……消失了……？","source_cn":"那片潮光……是什么？为什么深海裔走进去光芒中，就……消...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB809841B2B8ED4B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1910521002":{"text":"那片潮光……是什么？为什么深海裔走进去光芒中，就……消失了……？","source_cn":"那片潮光……是什么？为什么深海裔走进去光芒中，就……消失了……？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB809841B2B8ED4B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910521003:1":{"text":"미안하구나, 얘야. 할미가 아는 노래들 중에도 저런 빛의 해일에 관한 이야기는 없단다.","source_cn":"很抱歉，孩子。连我所知的歌谣里，从未提及过这种潮光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02E743458FAA21CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910521004:1":{"text":"이곳은 평소 회유기에 잠수하는 범위를 한참 벗어난 곳이야. 파도 장로가 우리를 이렇게 깊고 먼 해역까지 데려온 적은 없었단다.","source_cn":"此处已经超出了寻常洄游季下潜的范围，波涛长者从未带我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x030F357E3DA3C3BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910521005:1":{"text":"별빛 바다 깊은 곳에 저렇게 아름답고도 치명적인 존재가 있을 줄이야...","source_cn":"我也不知道，流光海的深处，竟然还有如此美丽而致命的存在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4562F4E841C03B2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"빛의 해일이 생물을 녹여 버리는 건가?!","source_cn":"那种潮光会溶解生物？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x82CFE076CBAAD088","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"빛의 해일이 생물을 녹여 버리는 건가?!","female":"빛의 해일이 생물을 녹여 버리는 건가?!","variant_male_record_index":"95682","variant_female_record_index":"95683","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910521006:1":{"text":"우리를... 이길 수 없어서?","source_cn":"因为……打不过咱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3150C87BABC788CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910521007:1":{"text":"아니야... 아무리 우리를 이길 수 없었다 해도, 왜 굳이 제 발로 빛의 해일 속에 들어간 거지? 마치... 누군가에게 조종당하는 것 같았어.","source_cn":"不对……就算打不过，他们为什么又要主动走到潮光里？那个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE5B9C60ADFC4A4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910521008:1":{"text":"갑자기 멈추고 다 같은 방향을 바라보다가, 말없이 빛의 해일 속으로 걸어 들어갔잖아...","source_cn":"突然停下所有动作，看向同一个方向，默默地走进潮光中……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CDC9ABE79108EBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910521009:1":{"text":"可能……他们，想回家了。\n我也……想回家，好可怕……","source_cn":"可能……他们，想回家了。\\n我也……想回家，好可怕……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x60492DE90E734E95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910521010:1":{"text":"샤이, 무서워하지 마. 무슨 일이 있어도 언니가 지켜 줄게.","source_cn":"小汐儿，别害怕，姐姐发誓，无论发生什么，我都会保护你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32143B8DB69E4B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910521011:1":{"text":"马上，马上我们就带你回家，好吗？","source_cn":"马上，马上我们就带你回家，好吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCF5B7105A1B437CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"심해족들은 왜 제 발로 빛의 해일에 들어간 거지?","source_cn":"深海裔为何主动走入那片潮光？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1A2865ED80B65F96","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"심해족들은 왜 제 발로 빛의 해일에 들어간 거지?","female":"심해족들은 왜 제 발로 빛의 해일에 들어간 거지?","variant_male_record_index":"95684","variant_female_record_index":"95685","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910521012:4":{"text":"내 생각엔 저 심해 물고기 놈들은 미쳐 버린 지 오래라 무슨 짓을 해도 이상할 게 없어. 굳이 힘 빼가며 저놈들이 무슨 생각을 하는지 알아내서 뭐 해?","source_cn":"要咱说，那群深海鱼早就疯了，做出什么事都不奇怪，咱们费...","status":"matched","has